Task: Retrieve the venue titles of publications that have a `date_inserted` from the year 2021 onwards and are associated with a grid whose address city is 'Qianjiang'. For each publication, prioritize the venue title by selecting the journal title first if it exists; if not, then the proceedings title; if that's also unavailable, then the book title; and finally, if none of those are available, the book series title.

Please answer only one complete SQL in bigquery dialect in ```sql``` format.
